     A          R HMNUREC
     A                                  1  2'Help - Main menu'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  3  3'Type the number of an option and p-
     A                                      ress Enter.'
     A                                  4  3'You can also put the cursor on a l-
     A                                      ine and press Enter to pick it.'
     A                                  6  3' 1  Calendar: appointments, meetin-
     A                                      gs, rooms, holidays and shared cale-
     A                                      ndars.'
     A                                  7  3' 2  Mail, messages and chat: a men-
     A                                      u of the three ways to reach people-
     A                                      .'
     A                                  8  3' 3  Notes, tasks and phone book: a-
     A                                       menu of your own organizer.'
     A                                  9  3' 4  Documents and spreadsheets, an-
     A                                      d the printed output they make.'
     A                                 10  3' 5  Search everything: one search -
     A                                      across all of your office items.'
     A                                 11  3' 6  Office directory: who is enrol-
     A                                      led.'
     A                                 12  3' 7  Games and the office cat.'
     A                                 13  3' 8  Printed output: everything you-
     A                                       printed with a Print key.'
     A                                 14  3' 9  Settings: your name and phone,-
     A                                       pop-ups, animations and more.'
     A                                 15  3'10  Administration: for office adm-
     A                                      inistrators only.'
     A                                 17  3'The counts beside the options show-
     A                                       what is waiting for you.'
     A                                 18  3'F3 or 90 leaves the office.  F5 re-
     A                                      freshes the counts.'
     A                                 23  2'Press Enter to return.'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A          R HPROF
     A                                  1  2'Help - Settings'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  3  3'Name, department and phone: how ot-
     A                                      hers see you in the office director-
     A                                      y.'
     A                                  4  3'Pop-up messages: Y shows reminders-
     A                                      , mail and chat requests at once.'
     A                                  5  3'Time zone: your offset from UTC, s-
     A                                      uch as -05:00.  New appointments us-
     A                                      e it'
     A                                  6  3'and are stored in office time.  Bl-
     A                                      ank means you are in office time.'
     A                                  7  3'Week starts on: S or M, for every -
     A                                      month on the screen.'
     A                                  8  3'Working day: new appointments star-
     A                                      t at the start, and the week and mo-
     A                                      nth'
     A                                  9  3'views are drawn around these hours-
     A                                      .'
     A                                 10  3'Units: I for 12-hour clock and M/D-
     A                                      /YYYY, M for 24-hour and D.M.YYYY.'
     A                                 11  3'Animations: N stops everything tha-
     A                                      t moves by itself.  Character is sh-
     A                                      own'
     A                                 12  3'on the calendar.  Screen saver: id-
     A                                      le minutes, 0 never.  Chat refresh:-
     A                                       A'
     A                                 13  3'shows new lines as they arrive, M -
     A                                      only when you press F5.'
     A                                 23  2'Press Enter to return.'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A          R HSUBM
     A                                  1  2'Help - Menu'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  3  3'Type the number of an option and p-
     A                                      ress Enter, or put the cursor on it'
     A                                  4  3'and press Enter.'
     A                                  6  3'The counts show new mail and messa-
     A                                      ges, and open tasks.'
     A                                  7  3'F12 goes back to the main menu.'
     A                                 23  2'Press Enter to return.'
